  "summary": "I'm a Full-Stack Developer passionate about building scalable web and mobile applications that solve real business problems.\nOver the years, I've worked across the complete product lifecycle—from designing databases and backend architectures to developing responsive user interfaces and integrating third-party APIs. My expertise includes JavaScript, React.js, React Native, Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, PostgreSQL, REST APIs, and cloud-based deployments.\nI enjoy transforming complex requirements into reliable, user-friendly solutions. Whether it's developing SaaS platforms, automating business workflows, integrating payment systems, creating document-processing solutions, or building high-performance APIs, my focus is always on delivering products that create measurable value.\nBeyond coding, I'm deeply interested in product thinking, system design, and leveraging technology to improve operational efficiency. I believe great software is not just about writing clean code—it's about understanding users, solving the right problems, and building solutions that scale.\nI'm always open to connecting with founders, businesses, and technology professionals who are building innovative products or looking to solve challenging technical problems.\nCore Skills: Full-Stack Development • MERN Stack • React.js • React Native • Node.js • Express.js • MongoDB • PostgreSQL • REST APIs • SaaS Development • System Design • API Integrations • JavaScript • Cloud Deployment • Performance Optimization",
